tall_cavity.rea
-3                     spatial dimension
1                     number of fields
#========================================================
#
#    Tall rectangular-prism cavity: one hot wall (x=0),
#    one cold wall (x=1, opposite the hot wall), and four
#    side walls (y=0,y=1,z=0,z=1) held at the mean of the
#    hot/cold temperatures. All six walls are no-slip.
#    Aspect ratio (height:width) = 4.
#
#    Numeric BC labels (1,2,3) rather than letter codes: an explicit
#    boundaryTypeMap on [FLUID VELOCITY]/[SCALAR TEMPERATURE] disables
#    nekRS's CBC-label auto-import of boundary IDs, so genbox needs to
#    write the IDs directly.
#
#========================================================
#
Box
-4 -4 -16          nelx,nely,nelz for Box
0 0.08 1               x0 x1 ratio
0 0.08 1               y0 y1 ratio
0 0.32 1               z0 z1 ratio
1  ,2  ,3  ,3  ,3  ,3     BCs (3 characters each!)
